,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">정부출연금 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">총사업비의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">75%</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이내에서 최대 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, 2</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">억원까지 지원</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">민간부담금 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">정부출연금 이외에 총사업비의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">25%</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이상을 부담<span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">민간부담금의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">40%</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이상은 현금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">신청기업 신청자격 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">중소기업기본법 제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">조에의한 중소기업으로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 다음의 조건 중 하나를 만족하는 기업</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">업력 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">년 이상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">매출액 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">50</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">억원 이상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">상시근로자수 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">인 이상</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">제출서류</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">첨부파일참조</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) : </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">파일 및 스캔파일로 제출</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;1) 중소기업기술개발지원사업계획서</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 신사업 분야 진출 계획서</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) 신용상태 조회동의서(주관, 공동)</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4) 개인정보 수집이용 동의서</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 5) 중소기업기술개발사업 청렴서약서</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;